Question: Perform the following in customer_data.csv
•	Histogram
•	Select only numeric columns
•	Compute correlation matrix
•	Plot heatmap

import pandas as pd
import matplotlib.pyplot as plt
import seaborn as sns
 
df = pd.read_csv("customer_data.csv")      # use the exact filename given
print(df.columns.tolist())
 
# Select only numeric columns (needed before the histogram)
